{"seq":4,"slug":"tools-practice","title":"工具与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"equipment","title":"分子料理工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice/equipment","wordCount":3647,"readingTime":15},{"seq":2,"slug":"ingredients-additives","title":"关键原料与添加剂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice/ingredients-additives","wordCount":5025,"readingTime":21},{"seq":3,"slug":"home-kitchen-apps","title":"家庭厨房应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice/home-kitchen-apps","wordCount":3562,"readingTime":15}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工具与实践\">工具与实践</h1><p>理论与技术最终要落到厨房的实际操作中。本章面向实践者：分子料理工具盘点从旋转蒸发仪到浸入式循环器的专业设备及其工作原理，关键原料与添加剂系统梳理海藻酸钠、卵磷脂、黄原胶等十余种核心原料的特性、用量与安全信息，家庭厨房应用则为没有专业设备的烹饪爱好者提供可操作的替代方案与入门项目。阅读本章后，读者应当能够根据手头条件选择合适的技术路径，而不必被&quot;分子料理=昂贵设备&quot;的刻板印象劝退。</p>\n"}